<title>USA: PIA Merchandising names new CFO.</title>
<headline>PIA Merchandising names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PIA Merchandising Services Inc on Monday named Cathy Wood as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Wood was previously chief financial officer, secretary and treasurer at the Giant Group Ltd.</p>
<p>No one at PIA was immediately available for further information. Last August the company named Roy Olofson as CFO, replacing Robert Polentz.</p>
